[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Validation[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe project validates important inputs before processing them.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mExamples include:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Topic must not be empty.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Token limits must be valid.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Structured requests should contain the expected information.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Invalid input should produce meaningful errors.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Testing[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mTests are implemented using `pytest`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mRun the test suite with:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32mpytest -q[m
