[32m+[m[32m## Security[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSensitive files should not be committed to Git.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe `.gitignore` protects:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32m.venv/[m
