[32m+[m[32mdef product_code_exists([m
[32m+[m[32m    shelf_grid: list[list[str]],[m
[32m+[m[32m    product_code: str,[m
[32m+[m[32m    max_rows: int = DEFAULT_MAX_ROWS,[m
[32m+[m[32m    max_columns: int = DEFAULT_MAX_COLUMNS,[m
[32m+[m[32m    max_word_length: int = DEFAULT_MAX_WORD_LENGTH,[m
[32m+[m[32m    timeout_seconds: float = DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS,[m
[32m+[m[32m) -> bool:[m
[32m+[m[32m    """Return whether a product code exists in the shelf grid.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    The search moves horizontally or vertically through adjacent[m
[32m+[m[32m    cells. A grid cell cannot be reused within the same path.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Args:[m
[32m+[m[32m        shelf_grid: Rectangular warehouse grid.[m
[32m+[m[32m        product_code: Product code to search for.[m
[32m+[m[32m        max_rows: Maximum allowed number of rows.[m
[32m+[m[32m        max_columns: Maximum allowed number of columns.[m
[32m+[m[32m        max_word_length: Maximum allowed product-code length.[m
[32m+[m[32m        timeout_seconds: Maximum search duration.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Returns:[m
[32m+[m[32m        True when the product code can be found, otherwise False.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Raises:[m
[32m+[m[32m        TypeError: If an input has an invalid type.[m
[32m+[m[32m        ValueError: If an input has an invalid value.[m
[32m+[m[32m        GridValidationError: If the grid is invalid.[m
[32m+[m[32m        ProductCodeValidationError: If the product code is invalid.[m
[32m+[m[32m        SearchTimeoutError: If the search exceeds the time limit.[m
