[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Depth is measured by the number of nodes on the longest path[m
[32m+[m[32m    from the root to a leaf.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    An empty tree has depth 0.[m
[32m+[m[32m    A single-node tree has depth 1.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Args:[m
[32m+[m[32m        root: Root employee of the hierarchy.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Returns:[m
[32m+[m[32m        Maximum number of nodes from root to a leaf.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Raises:[m
[32m+[m[32m        HierarchyCycleError: If a cycle is detected.[m
